# =====================================================================
# LLMS.txt — The Weather Network (TWN)
# Purpose: Provide clear guidance to AI agents, crawlers, and LLM systems
# regarding permitted access, usage, attribution, and training restrictions.
# This file is descriptive and policy-based. Enforcement occurs via robots.txt.
